@THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062
@ApiKey = OTnKinqjAiKAK85pzwmVUA8Y7Pnw4FfeEPoEuptxgEdDfUp4BOZM1MSN6rv9Hg4i
@DollyNo = TDC-E200GC2
@RefNo = CD-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXXXX

### 1) Talep kaydet (SUCCESS beklenir; cevaptaki referenceNumber'ı @RefNo'ya yapıştırın)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "OUTBOUND",
  "awbNumber": "23512345678",
  "flightNumber": "TK0001",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "departureStation": "IST",
  "arrivalStation": "JFK",
  "sccCode": "PIL",
  "uldNumber": "AKE12345TK",
  "coolDollyNumber": "{{DollyNo}}"
}

### 2) Aynı isteği tekrar gönder (idempotent: aynı referenceNumber, "Talep zaten kayıtlı")
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "OUTBOUND",
  "awbNumber": "23512345678",
  "flightNumber": "TK0001",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "departureStation": "IST",
  "arrivalStation": "JFK",
  "sccCode": "PIL",
  "uldNumber": "AKE12345TK",
  "coolDollyNumber": "{{DollyNo}}"
}

### 3) Aynı Dolly'ye farklı AWB/ULD (409, CD-002 beklenir)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "INBOUND",
  "awbNumber": "23587654321",
  "flightNumber": "TK0002",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "departureStation": "JFK",
  "arrivalStation": "IST",
  "sccCode": "PIL",
  "uldNumber": "PMC54321TK",
  "coolDollyNumber": "{{DollyNo}}"
}

### 4) Geçersiz işlem tipi (400, CD-005 beklenir)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "XYZ",
  "awbNumber": "23512345678",
  "flightNumber": "TK0001",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "departureStation": "IST",
  "arrivalStation": "JFK",
  "uldNumber": "AKE12345TK",
  "coolDollyNumber": "{{DollyNo}}"
}

### 5) Var olmayan Dolly (400, CD-001 beklenir)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "OUTBOUND",
  "awbNumber": "23512345678",
  "flightNumber": "TK0001",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "departureStation": "IST",
  "arrivalStation": "JFK",
  "uldNumber": "AKE12345TK",
  "coolDollyNumber": "YOK-BOYLE-BIR-DOLLY"
}

### 6) API key olmadan (401, CD-008 beklenir)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/CreateRequest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationType": "OUTBOUND" }

### 7) Talep sonlandır (SUCCESS, Dolly tekrar müsait)
POST {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/CoolDolly/TerminateRequest
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "operationType": "OUTBOUND",
  "requestReferenceNo": "{{RefNo}}",
  "flightNumber": "TK0001",
  "flightDate": "2026-10-16",
  "coolDollyNumber": "{{DollyNo}}"
}

### 8) Liste ekranı: açık talepler (Dolly içindeki ULD/AWB'ler)
GET {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/DollyRequest/GetAll?status=Open&page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

### 9) Liste ekranı: Cool Dolly No ile filtre
GET {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/DollyRequest/GetAll?coolDollyNo={{DollyNo}}
Accept: application/json

### 10) Bir Dolly'nin içindeki açık kayıtlar (DollyId = 1)
GET {{THYLoggerAPI_POSTGRESQL_HostAddress}}/api/DollyRequest/GetByDolly/1
Accept: application/json
